<main class="static-page"><div class="static-inner">
  <div class="static-icon">❓</div>
  <h1 class="static-title">Help Centre</h1>
  <div class="static-body">
<div class="help-search"><input type="text" placeholder="Search for answers…" class="help-search-input" oninput="filterFAQ(this.value)"/></div><div id="faq-list"><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">How do I verify my profile? <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span></div><div class="faq-a">Go to Profile → tap the shield icon → follow the photo verification steps.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">How do I pay for Plus or VIP? <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span></div><div class="faq-a">Go to Pricing → choose Plus or VIP → click Upgrade → pay with any card via Stripe.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">My payment didn't go through — what do I do? <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span></div><div class="faq-a">Try a different card. If the problem persists, email <a href="mailto:support@heartlink.app">support@heartlink.app</a>.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">How do I delete my account? <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span></div><div class="faq-a">Go to Profile → Settings → Delete Account. Your data will be removed within 30 days.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">Is HeartLink available worldwide? <span class="faq-arrow">▼</span></div><div class="faq-a">Yes! HeartLink works in every country. We have active users across 180+ countries.</div></div></div><p style="margin-top:24px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Still stuck? Email <a href="mailto:support@heartlink.app">support@heartlink.app</a> or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/254706886473" target="_blank">+254 706 886 473</a></p><script>function toggleFAQ(el){const a=el.nextElementSibling;const open=a.style.display==="block";a.style.display=open?"none":"block";el.querySelector(".faq-arrow").textContent=open?"▼":"▲";}function filterFAQ(q){document.querySelectorAll(".faq-item").forEach(item=>{item.style.display=item.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(q.toLowerCase())?"block":"none";});}<\/script>
  </div>
</div></main>
